<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mission — {{.SiteName}}</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
    <script src="js/nav.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>

    {{template "nav" .}}

    <main class="mission-page">
        <h1>Our Mission</h1>
        <p>
            We believe meaningful progress comes through collaboration. By making knowledge and resources
            openly accessible—and by inviting people to contribute, improve, and share what
            they know here—we seek to strengthen the global community working to protect children and advance
            their rights.
        </p>

        <p>
            This site is a shared resource, not a competing organization. Our goal is to amplify the work of
            those already engaged in this cause, make it easier for everyoneto find reliable information
            and meaningful ways to get involved, and help bring together the knowledge and collective
            efforts needed to protect children from genital cutting.
        </p>

    </main>

    {{template "footer" .}}

</body>
</html>
